                                                "sense_id": "ee069862-74d3-3df6-a10d-8adb4619846f",
                                                "text": "The tax assessor put them in fourteen valuation groups ranging from one two-story brick house and two one-and-a-half-story houses to the largest groups of eighteen two-story houses and twenty-four one-story bungalows."
                                            },
